; bal -V --unrealized must foot to zero when a price change precedes the
; report's last posting.  Two lots of AAPL are bought on different dates;
; the second purchase records AAPL at $160, which revalues the first lot
; before the last posting.  Since 75c9c37a5 the balance report dropped
; that revaluation (src/filters.cc, changed_value_posts::operator()),
; showing Equity:Unrealized Gains $-200 and a total of $100, while
; bal -G reports a gain of $300.  The parent commit 5e9504404 footed.
; Under --dc the revaluation keeps the report's debit and credit columns:
; the unrealized row sits in the debit column, beside the revalued lots,
; and both columns total $3100.  Under --round the amount expression values
; each posting at the market price before it rounds it, so each lot
; contributes dollars that a second valuation leaves as they are; the lots
; are still booked at their cost, and the report foots.  Only the first
; purchase is cleared, and the cleared report revalues each of its columns
; against its own cost: the cleared column books $-200, as bal --cleared
; does, and both columns total zero.  The report used to book $-200 in the
; total column and $-100 in the cleared column, and to total $100 in each.

2024/01/01 * Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Checking

2024/02/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $160
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/01 AAPL $170

test bal -V --unrealized
                $300  Assets
               $3400    Brokerage
              $-3100    Checking
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal --exchange $ --unrealized
                $300  Assets
               $3400    Brokerage
              $-3100    Checking
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --dc
         $3400          $3100           $300  Assets
         $3400              0          $3400    Brokerage
             0          $3100         $-3100    Checking
          $300              0          $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
-------------- -------------- --------------
         $3100          $3100              0
end test

test bal -G
                $300  Assets:Brokerage
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --round
                $300  Assets
               $3400    Brokerage
              $-3100    Checking
               $-300  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test cleared -V --unrealized
            $300                $200                 Assets
           $3400               $1700    24-Jan-01      Brokerage
          $-3100              $-1500    24-Jan-01      Checking
           $-300               $-200                 Equity:Unrealized Gains
----------------  ------------------    ---------
               0                   0             
end test

test bal -V --unrealized --cleared
                $200  Assets
               $1700    Brokerage
              $-1500    Checking
               $-200  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test
